Cell["\<\
Now consider the following new Toolkit rules, the Metric Differentiation \
Rules, needed for identities that involve derivatives of the metric:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978723120871808*^9, 3.97872312087333*^9}, {
   3.978723165469028*^9, 3.978723207620385*^9}, 3.9787233650029182`*^9, {
