Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Compiler Backend Proof of Concept", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9776664385500717`*^9, 3.977666451075994*^9}, {
  3.977666687966083*^9, 
  3.977666692952118*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"65f8f0a4-21df-4c09-99cd-\
7a0a945ac596"],

Cell["\<\
In this section of the notebook, we develop a single-purpose compiler \
component that lowers \[ScriptCapitalU]\[ScriptCapitalD] expressions of the \
Schwarzschild metric and its Christoffel symbols onto functions in the \
Wolfram Function Repository (WFR). As above, this section is presented in \
alternating prose-and-code style rather than in .wl block style. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9776725977128963`*^9, 3.9776726026507998`*^9}, {
  3.977672653601965*^9, 3.977672845339478*^9}, {3.977675012800189*^9, 
  3.977675032789912*^9}, {3.977677054377393*^9, 3.9776770662600718`*^9}, {
  3.977679221198496*^9, 3.977679228093412*^9}, {3.9776820718431873`*^9, 
  3.9776820736872272`*^9}, {3.9776830689589643`*^9, 3.9776830802923822`*^9}, {
  3.977748810317973*^9, 
  3.977748844305373*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8be2e31b-dd03-4292-86df-\
0a4c712d11b2"],

